    hellG2 13167 (((rowSplit c wl ws).lam0 a - (rowSplit c wl ws).lamb a) ^ 2 *
      normSq c.2.1.2) ((rowSplit c wl ws).S0 a) ((rowSplit c wl ws).Sb a)
      ∂muI 13167 ≤ displacementBudget

